module bankr-waw-local-rules.local-rules

import core.states.washington.{ frbp9006-washington }
import frbp.events.{ FirstMeetingDate, OrderForReliefEntered, PetitionFiled }

// The Bankr. W.D. Wash. court's own periods, counted under FRBP 9006(a).
// Each is declared in the Local Rules effective December 1, 2023 and, from
// December 1, 2026, in the amended Local Rules General Order 2026-6 adopts
// (entered October 26, 2026), each version citing its own vendored text;
// a period they add begins on December 1, 2026. Two periods of the 2023
// rules the 2026 rules delete are declared `repealed` at December 1, 2026:
// the individual debtor in possession's six-month budget 14 days after the
// order for relief (LBR 2015-1(c) (2023)) and chapter 13 fees above the
// presumptive fee on application not more than 21 days after confirmation
// (LBR 2016-1(e)(2) (2023)). A third, the redacted version filed within 7
// days of an order to redact (LBR 9018-1(g) (2023)), is not declared: the
// package has no event for the order to redact. The FRBP periods (schedules and their
// extension, the chapter 13 plan, claims in chapter 7, 12 and 13 cases,
// exemptions, discharge, dischargeability, the adversary answer and
// summons, new trial, appeals) are lit/frbp's and are not declared again;
// the debtor's documents 7 days before the § 341 meeting (LBR 4002-1;
// FRBP 4002(b), 11 U.S.C. § 521(e)(2)) are not repeated.
//
// Stated in the rules but not declared: the one-business-day dismissals
// for missing signatures (LBR 1017-1(a), (b)); the 7- and 15-day notices
// the docket must show before a dismissal (LBR 1017-1(b), (d), (f)); the
// 7-day limit on extending schedules near the § 341 meeting (LBR
// 1007-1(a)); the 7-day currency of a mailing list (LBR 2002-1(e)); the
// trustee's three-day answer on a § 341 request (LBR 2003-1(b)); the
// United States Trustee's 7-day endorsement period (LBR 2014-1(b)); the
// 7-day notice on which the United States Trustee may move to convert (LBR
// 2015-1); the 30-day § 362(e) waiver (LBR 4001-1(b)); the 5- and 3-day
// disclosure statement and confirmation filings (LBR 3017-1(b), (c),
// 3018-1, 3020-1(a)); the "later of" and "earlier" deadlines (a claim
// after an amended schedule, LBR 1009-1(c); the jury demand and consent,
// LBR 9015-1(b), (c); the removal report, LBR 9027-1(c); a party's notice
// regarding final adjudication, LBR 7012-1(d)); the clerk's 28-day
// transmittal and 60-day reclosing (LBR 5011-1(c), 5010-1(e)); and the
// mediation program's periods (LBR 9045-1, 9049-1). The earlier outline's
// Supreme Court decisions construe the Code and the FRBP, not these rules,
// and are removed here: no reporter text is vendored.
/// A chapter 11 debtor or trustee amends the schedules to add or change a
/// creditor's claim (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 1009-1(c)).
event ScheduleAmendmentFiled()
/// Notice of an amendment of the schedules is transmitted to the creditor
/// (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 1009-1(c)).
event AmendmentNoticeTransmitted()
/// An order confirming a plan is entered (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3007-1(a)).
event PlanConfirmed()
/// A document prepared by a bankruptcy petition preparer is filed (Bankr.
/// W.D. Wash. LBR 2016-2).
event PreparerDocumentFiled()
/// The hearing on confirmation of a plan (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3015-1(d),
/// 3020-1(b)).
event ConfirmationHearing()
/// A chapter 13 debtor completes all plan payments (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR
/// 3015-1(l)).
event PlanPaymentsCompleted()
/// The hearing on a disclosure statement (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3017-1(a)).
event DisclosureStatementHearing()
/// A motion to withdraw the reference is served (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR
/// 5011-1(b)).
event WithdrawalMotionServed()
/// A motion to withdraw the reference is filed (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR
/// 5011-1(b)).
event WithdrawalMotionFiled()
/// Service of a summons and complaint is effected (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR
/// 7004-1).
event SummonsServed()
/// A notice of removal is filed (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7012-1(b),
/// 9027-1(b)).
event RemovalNoticeFiled()
/// A proceeding is transferred from a district judge to a bankruptcy judge
/// under Local Civil Rule 87(b) (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7012-1(c)).
event ProceedingTransferred()
/// The proposed pretrial order is filed (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7016-1(b)).
event ProposedPretrialOrderFiled()
/// The scheduled trial date (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7016-1(b)).
event TrialDate()
/// The date fixed for hearing a motion (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 9013-1(d)).
event MotionHearing()
/// A judgment or order is entered (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 9013-1(h)).
event OrderEntered()
/// The date set for presentation of a proposed order (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR
/// 9013-1(i)).
event OrderPresentation()
/// The removing party's report of proceedings is filed (Bankr. W.D. Wash.
/// LBR 9027-1(d)).
event RemovalReportFiled()
/// An answer or other response to the complaint is filed in an adversary
/// proceeding (Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 9040-3).
event AdversaryAnswerFiled()

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 1009-1(c): when a chapter 11 debtor or trustee
/// amends the schedules to add or change a creditor's claim, notice of the
/// amendment and of the creditor's right to file a claim is transmitted
/// within 14 days (the rules effective December 1, 2023).
deadline amendment-notice-period: 14.days after ScheduleAmendmentFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 1009-1(c)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 1009-1(c), from December 1, 2026
/// (General Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline amendment-notice-period: 14.days after ScheduleAmendmentFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes amendment-notice-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 1009-1(c)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 1009-1(c): the certificate of service of that
/// notice is filed within 7 days (the rules effective December 1, 2023).
deadline amendment-notice-certificate-period: 7.days after AmendmentNoticeTransmitted() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 1009-1(c)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 1009-1(c), from December 1, 2026
/// (General Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline amendment-notice-certificate-period: 7.days after AmendmentNoticeTransmitted() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes amendment-notice-certificate-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 1009-1(c)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 1017-1(c): a voluntary debtor files the list of
/// creditors no later than 7 days from the filing of the petition, or the
/// case may be dismissed (the rules effective December 1, 2023).
deadline creditor-list-period: 7.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 1017-1(c)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 1017-1(c), from December 1, 2026
/// (General Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline creditor-list-period: 7.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes creditor-list-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 1017-1(c)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 2015-1(b)(1): a chapter 11 debtor in possession
/// provides the United States Trustee its most recent federal income tax
/// return within 14 days after the order for relief (the rules effective
/// December 1, 2023).
deadline dip-tax-return-period: 14.days after OrderForReliefEntered() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 2015-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 2015-1(b), from December 1, 2026
/// (General Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline dip-tax-return-period: 14.days after OrderForReliefEntered() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes dip-tax-return-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 2015-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 2015-1(b)(2): the debtor in possession provides
/// initial proof of insurance within 7 days after the order for relief (the
/// rules effective December 1, 2023).
deadline dip-insurance-period: 7.days after OrderForReliefEntered() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 2015-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 2015-1(b), from December 1, 2026
/// (General Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline dip-insurance-period: 7.days after OrderForReliefEntered() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes dip-insurance-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 2015-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 2015-1(c): an individual debtor in possession
/// files a projected budget for the six months after the petition within
/// 14 days after the order for relief (the rules effective December 1,
/// 2023). The amended rules of December 1, 2026 drop it.
deadline dip-budget-period: 14.days after OrderForReliefEntered() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) repealed cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 2015-1(c)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 2016-1(e)(2): chapter 13 attorneys' fees above
/// the presumptive fee are requested by application not more than 21 days
/// after the order of confirmation (the rules effective December 1, 2023).
/// The amended rules of December 1, 2026 drop it.
deadline excess-fee-application-period: 21.days after PlanConfirmed() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) repealed cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 2016-1(e)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 2016-2: a bankruptcy petition preparer serves
/// Official Form B119 and the disclosure of compensation on the United
/// States Trustee within fourteen days after filing (the rules effective
/// December 1, 2023).
deadline preparer-disclosure-period: 14.days after PreparerDocumentFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 2016-2"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 2016-2, from December 1, 2026 (General
/// Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline preparer-disclosure-period: 14.days after PreparerDocumentFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes preparer-disclosure-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 2016-2"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3007-1(a): unless the court orders otherwise,
/// objections to claims in a chapter 11 case are filed and served no later
/// than 60 days after entry of the order confirming a plan (the rules
/// effective December 1, 2023).
deadline chapter-11-claim-objection-period: 60.days after PlanConfirmed() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3007-1(a)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 3007-1(a), from December 1, 2026
/// (General Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline chapter-11-claim-objection-period: 60.days after PlanConfirmed() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes chapter-11-claim-objection-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 3007-1(a)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3007-1(b): objections to claims in a chapter 13
/// case are filed and served no later than 270 days from the petition date,
/// unless good cause is shown (the rules effective December 1, 2023).
deadline chapter-13-claim-objection-period: 270.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3007-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 3007-1(b), from December 1, 2026
/// (General Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline chapter-13-claim-objection-period: 270.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes chapter-13-claim-objection-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 3007-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3015-1(c)(2): a chapter 13 plan filed after the
/// petition is served on all creditors at least 14 days before the
/// originally scheduled meeting of creditors (the rules effective December
/// 1, 2023).
deadline plan-service-period: 14.days before FirstMeetingDate() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3015-1(c)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 3015-1(c), from December 1, 2026
/// (General Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline plan-service-period: 14.days before FirstMeetingDate() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes plan-service-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 3015-1(c)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3015-1(d)(1): the debtor files a mandatory reply
/// to an objection to confirmation no later than 7 days before the
/// confirmation hearing (the rules effective December 1, 2023).
deadline confirmation-reply-period: 7.days before ConfirmationHearing() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3015-1(d)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 3015-1(d), from December 1, 2026
