deadline confirmation-reply-period: 7.days before ConfirmationHearing() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes confirmation-reply-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 3015-1(d)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3015-1(l): within 30 days of completion of all
/// plan payments, chapter 13 debtors file their domestic support
/// certifications (the rules effective December 1, 2023).
deadline domestic-support-certification-period: 30.days after PlanPaymentsCompleted() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3015-1(l)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 3015-1(l), from December 1, 2026
