/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3020-1(b): unless the court orders otherwise,
/// objections to confirmation of a plan are filed and served at least 7
/// days before the confirmation hearing (the rules effective December 1,
/// 2023).
deadline confirmation-objection-period: 7.days before ConfirmationHearing() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 3020-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 3020-1(b), from December 1, 2026
/// (General Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline confirmation-objection-period: 7.days before ConfirmationHearing() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes confirmation-objection-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 3020-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 5011-1(b): responses to a motion to withdraw the
/// reference are filed and served no later than 14 days after its service
/// (the rules effective December 1, 2023).
deadline withdrawal-response-period: 14.days after WithdrawalMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 5011-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 5011-1(b), from December 1, 2026
/// (General Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline withdrawal-response-period: 14.days after WithdrawalMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes withdrawal-response-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 5011-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 5011-1(b): a reply, if any, is filed and served no
/// later than 21 days after the filing of the motion (the rules effective
/// December 1, 2023).
deadline withdrawal-reply-period: 21.days after WithdrawalMotionFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 5011-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 5011-1(b), from December 1, 2026
/// (General Order 2026-6): the same period, carried into the amended rules.
deadline withdrawal-reply-period: 21.days after WithdrawalMotionFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes withdrawal-reply-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 5011-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7004-1: the plaintiff files a certificate of
/// service within 14 days after service of a summons and complaint is
/// effected (the rules effective December 1, 2023).
deadline summons-certificate-period: 14.days after SummonsServed() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7004-1"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 7004-1, from December 1, 2026 (General
