deadline summons-certificate-period: 14.days after SummonsServed() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes summons-certificate-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 7004-1"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7012-1(b): not later than 14 days after the notice
/// of removal is filed, each other party that has filed a pleading in the
/// removed matter files a Notice Regarding Final Adjudication and Consent
