deadline removal-adjudication-notice-period: 14.days after RemovalNoticeFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7012-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 7012-1(b), from December 1, 2026
