/// 2026-6).
deadline referred-adjudication-notice-period: 14.days after ProceedingTransferred() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 7012-1(c)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7016-1(b)(1): the plaintiff's pretrial statement
