deadline defendant-pretrial-statement-period: 14.days before ProposedPretrialOrderFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7016-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 7016-1(b), from December 1, 2026
