deadline defendant-pretrial-statement-period: 14.days before ProposedPretrialOrderFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes defendant-pretrial-statement-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 7016-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7016-1(b)(3): the conference of attorneys is held
/// not later than 7 days before the filing of the proposed pretrial order
/// (the rules effective December 1, 2023).
deadline pretrial-conference-of-attorneys-period: 7.days before ProposedPretrialOrderFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7016-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 7016-1(b), from December 1, 2026
