deadline pretrial-conference-of-attorneys-period: 7.days before ProposedPretrialOrderFiled() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes pretrial-conference-of-attorneys-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 7016-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 7016-1(b)(4): the proposed pretrial order is filed
/// no later than 7 days before the scheduled trial date (the rules
