deadline proposed-pretrial-order-period: 7.days before TrialDate() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes proposed-pretrial-order-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 7016-1(b)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 9013-1(d): objections to claims are filed and
/// served at least 30 days before the hearing (the rules effective December
/// 1, 2023).
deadline claim-objection-notice-period: 30.days before MotionHearing() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 9013-1(d)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 9013-1(d), from December 1, 2026
