deadline claim-objection-notice-period: 30.days before MotionHearing() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2026-12-01, ..) supersedes claim-objection-notice-period@2023-12-01 cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 9013-1(d)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 9013-1(d): motions for summary judgment and lien
/// avoidance are filed and served at least 28 days before the hearing (the
/// rules effective December 1, 2023).
deadline summary-judgment-notice-period: 28.days before MotionHearing() counted_by frbp9006-washington effective [2023-12-01, 2026-12-01) cite "Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR 9013-1(d)"

/// Bankr. W.D. Wash. LBR (Dec. 2026) 9013-1(d), from December 1, 2026
